## Other

- How the two directories relate to version control follows the repository they live in; decide per workspace whether shared material and the sub-repositories it references are committed
- `scripts/check-project.py` checks broken links, front matter, stale `active` documents, unregistered `owner_task` IDs, and repeated key facts; run it at session start and before commits, and never mark a task `done` while it reports failures
- {{OTHER_CONVENTIONS}}
